# Copy to .env and `chmod 600 .env`. Never commit .env (it is in .gitignore and .dockerignore).
# Optional: you can also paste the keys on the Settings page instead (saved to data/secrets, mode 600).
XAI_API_KEY=
# Google (Nano Banana 2). Create the key in Google AI Studio; new keys are auth keys (unrestricted standard keys are rejected).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Extra host names the app accepts besides localhost, 127.0.0.1 and [::1] (A1 pin 17), e.g. the Tailscale name:
# RSR_ALLOWED_HOSTS=<machine>.<tailnet>.ts.net
